{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/libertyfleet/items/80573/", "pk": 80573, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/libertyfleet/", "pk": 23095, "shortname": "libertyfleet", "name": "Liberty Fleet of Tall Ships", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Liberty Star Day Sail", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 2, "unicode": "Liberty Star Day Sail", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "Ahoy, this sail is full!", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 0.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 2000, "description": "#*Get a look at beautiful Boston from the water - from the deck of a real tall ship!*\n\n## Duration\n\n1.5 Hours\n\n## About\n\nCome out for a day sail adventure in Boston Harbor aboard our classic schooner, the Liberty Star. Get away from the hustle and bustle of the city streets and enjoy some quality time out on the water with unbeatable views of the city.\n\nDrinks are available onboard for purchase via cash, credit, or Apple Pay - our menu includes several beers brewed right here in South Boston! We also have red and white wine, vodka- and rum-based cocktails, soda, juice, and water available in addition to several snack options.\n\nSnacks and bag lunches are welcome, but please no coolers or outside beverages.\n\nThere is no formal narration during our daysails, but feel free to ask the captain \nand crew and they’ll happily share their knowledge of local landmarks and history.", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#Thank you for booking with Liberty Fleet!\n\n---\n\nPlease arrive 15-30 minutes prior to the sail so you don't miss the boat! If you don't see the boat at the dock they are still out with the previous sail. \n\nWe embark and disembark passengers at **Fan Pier Marina**; please see [this link](https://libertyfleet.com/location/) for a map and additional details. \n\nAs it can be cooler on the water you may want to bring a light jacket or sweater. We also recommend closed-toes shoes.\n\nPlease refer to our [FAQ section](https://libertyfleet.com/faq/) or call the office with any questions - (617) 742-0333. \n\nMinimum drinking age is 21 years.  Onboard we accept Apple Pay, credit cards, or cash.\n\n---\n\nSee you soon!", "cancellation_notes": "The Liberty Fleet reserves the right to cancel any sail for inclement weather, a private charter event, or other unforeseen circumstances. If the Company cancels your cruise you may reschedule to another comparable sail, or if unable to reschedule you will receive a full refund for the ticket price. We know plans change – if you need to cancel your sail please let us know more than 48 hours in advance and we will refund the full ticket price. We do not offer refunds for cancellations less than 48 hours before your scheduled sail.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "1.5 Hour Boston Harbor Sail", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/libertyfleet/items/80573/images/139249/", "pk": 139249, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/fdJQMEtpTlOZ9ED39hgs", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.file